商业使用明确禁止，包括但不限于：
- 付费算命或任何形式的有偿命理服务
- 引流变现、植入广告
- 打包转售、作为商业化产品的一部分
- 任何以商业盈利为目的的使用

Forbidden commercial use includes, but is not limited to:
- Paid fortune-telling or any form of paid divination service
- Traffic monetization, advertising placement
- Resale, bundling as a commercial product
- Any use for commercial profit purposes

